Common Type InternationalAddress
    documentation 'Addresses located outside of the United States.
    enumeration AddressType
        documentation 'The type of address listed for an individual or organization. For example:  Physical 
                      'Address, Mailing Address, Home Address, etc.)
        is part of identity
    shared string AddressLine named AddressLine1
        documentation 'The first line of the address.
        is required
    shared string AddressLine named AddressLine2
        documentation 'The second line of the address.
        is optional
    shared string AddressLine named AddressLine3
        documentation 'The third line of the address.
        is optional
    shared string AddressLine named AddressLine4
        documentation 'The fourth line of the address.
        is optional
    descriptor Country
        documentation 'The name of the country.
        is required
    shared string Coordinate named Latitude
        documentation 'The geographic latitude of the physical address.
        is optional
    shared string Coordinate named Longitude
        documentation 'The geographic longitude of the physical address.
        is optional
    date BeginDate
        documentation 'The first date the address is valid. For physical addresses, the date the 
                      'person moved to that address.
        is optional
    date EndDate
        documentation 'The last date the address is valid. For physical addresses, this would be the date 
                      'the person moved from that address.
        is optional